# GuitarApp server-side voice API keys — COPY THIS FILE TO .env AND FILL IN.
# The .env file is gitignored (secrets never committed). The server reads these
# on startup (serve.mjs) so the synthesis key stays server-side and out of the
# client bundle. Shell environment variables always override values here.
#
# You need AT LEAST ONE provider configured for /api/tts to return audio:
#
# --- Option A: OpenAI TTS (permitted stopgap, paid per call) -----------------
# Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Option B: Chatterbox (THE shipping realistic voice, AMENDMENT-06, MIT) --
# Point this at your Resemble-hosted OR self-hosted Chatterbox-compatible server.
# Endpoint contract: POST JSON { text, voice_id, style? } -> audio/wav.
CHATTERBOX_API_URL=
CHATTERBOX_API_KEY=

# --- Option C: Anthropic Claude API (coaching prose, AMENDMENT-11) --------
# The coaching prose loop (lesson -> practice -> coach response) uses Claude
# to generate personalized feedback from practice data. This key is never sent
# to the browser.
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Optional server tuning ------------------------------------------------
# PORT=8080
# HTTPS_PORT=8443
